equested Qualifications Master’s Degree, Doctorate preferred Current NCCPA Certification/PA-C Nebraska State PA License (or license-eligible) Preferred: PA education experience Program Contributor (Lecturer, Preceptor, Admissions or Skills Instructor) Application Instructions Applicants will be required to attach a cover letter and up to date resume to the online application. If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact hr@creighton.edu Equal Employment Opportunity Statement AAP/EEO Statement Creighton University is committed to providing a safe and non-discriminatory educational and employment environment. The University admits qualified students, hires qualified employees and accepts patients for treatment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, marital status, national origin, age, disability, citizenship, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, veteran status, or other status protected by law. Its education and employment policies, scholarship and loan programs, and other programs and activities, are administered without unlawful discrimination. Department Physician Assistant Program - Omaha Posted Mon, 09/14/2026 Apply by Open until filled Applying Creighton University uses Interfolio to manage the application process. Need help? Contact help and support . Share Email Facebook LinkedIn Twitter Close Sidebar ID Internal Resources Directory Office 365 BlueLine NEST Libraries Bookstore myCreighton Online Ministries Site Index Get In Touch Contact Creighton Jobs Maps & Directions Media Inquiries Locations Omaha, NE Phoenix, AZ 2500 California Plaza Omaha, NE 68178 402.280.2700 Image Translate © Creighton University\t2026 Legal / Non-Discrimination Policy Privacy Statement Web Accessibility Statement LinkedIn Facebook Instagram Youtube © Creighton University\t2026 LinkedIn Facebook Instagram Youtube"
