ey Contacts Campus Locations, Maps and Parking Campus and Regional Locations Campus Maps Parking and Transportation News and Events Blog Creighton Magazine Media Coverage News Events Institutional Accreditation Academic and Non-Academic Accreditation Creighton Commitments Athletics Alumni Give Search Search Site Search Directory Filter by School College of Arts and Sciences College of Nursing, Omaha Campus College of Nursing, Phoenix Campus College of Professional and Continuing Education Creighton University Staff Heider College of Business School of Dentistry School of Law School of Medicine, Omaha Campus School of Medicine, Phoenix Campus School of Pharmacy and Health Professions, Omaha Campus School of Pharmacy and Health Professions, Phoenix Campus University Libraries Filter by Department Accounting Accounting and Business Intelligence & Analytics Anesthesiology Anesthesiology (Phoenix) Biology Biomedical Sciences Business Intelligence and Analytics Chemistry and Biochemistry Clinical Research and Public Health Communication Studies Computer Science, Design and Journalism Cultural and Social Studies Dean's Office - Arts & Sciences Economics and Finance Education Emergency Medicine Emergency Medicine (Phoenix) Endodontics English ENT Exercise Science and Pre-Health Professions Family and Community Medicine Family and Community Medicine (Phoenix) Fine & Performing Arts General Dentistry Health Professions History Interdisciplinary Studies Law Marketing and Management Mathematics Med. Microbiology & Immunology Medical Education Medical Education (Phoenix) Medical Humanities Medical Humanities (Phoenix) Medicine Medicine (Phoenix) Modern Languages and Literatures Neurological Surgery Neurological Surgery (Phoenix) Neurology Neurology (Phoenix) Nursing - Bachelors Nursing - Doctorate Nursing - Masters Obstetrics & Gynecology Obstetrics & Gynecology (Phoenix) Occupational Therapy Occupational Therapy (Phoenix) Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery Oral Biology Oral Health Promotion Orthopaedic Surgery (Omaha) Orthopaedic Surgery (Phoenix) Paramedicine Pathology Pathology (Phoenix) Pediatric Dentistry Pediatrics Pediatrics (Phoenix) Periodontics Pharmacology and Neuroscience Pharmacy Practice Pharmacy Practice (Phoenix) Pharmacy Sciences Philosophy Physical Therapy Physical Therapy (Phoenix) Physics Political Science and International Relations Prosthodontics Psychiatry Psychiatry (Phoenix) Psychological Science Radiology Radiology (Phoenix) Surgery Surgery (Phoenix) Surgical Services Theology Urology Close Menu All Positions / Faculty Instructor/Assistant Teaching Professor of Finance Apply now Description The Heider College of Business at Creighton University invites applications for a non-tenure track faculty position in finance with a start date of Fall 2027. Creighton University, located in Omaha, Nebraska, is a private Jesuit, Catholic university that encourages applications from qualified individuals of all backgrounds who believe they can contribute to the distinctive educational traditions and mission of the University. The College seeks a faculty member committed to excellence in teaching and pedagogical practices.   The candidate will teach undergraduate courses in corporate finance, investments, and financial modeling, with potential to teach other higher-level finance elective and graduate courses, for the Department of Economics and Finance. The teaching load is eight classes per academic year.  The candidate will also be expected to provide academic advising for students, as well as service to the College, University, and business community. Candidates with a combination of academic qualifications and relevant industry experience are encouraged to apply. The Heider College of Business is accredited by the AACSB with an enrollment of approximately 1100 undergraduate and 400 graduate students. Approximately 70 full-time faculty members, complemented by part-time professors, serve our students. Degrees awarded include the BSBA, MBA, and several specialized masters degrees.  For more information on the Heider College of Business see: http://business.creighton.edu . Qualifications Applicants must hold at least a Master’s degree in finance and have a minimum of two semesters of teaching experience, with evidence of classroom effectiveness. Candidates with the CFA ® or CFP ® credential and relevant professional experience are strongly preferred. Candidates with PhDs will be considered for an appointment at the rank of Assistant Teaching Professor.  This position requires applicants to be currently authorized to work in the United States on a full-time basis. Application Instructions To apply, please submit 1) cover letter, 2) CV, 3) list of three references, and 4) evidence of teaching effectiveness. Applications will be reviewed on a rolling basis until the position is filled. Questions may be sent to the Department Chair of Economics and Finance at: Lee M. Dunham, Ph.D., CFA Department Chair of Economics and Finance Heider College of Business Creighton University leedunham@creighton.edu Equal Employment Opportunity Statement AAP/EEO Statement Creighton University is committed to providing a safe and non-discriminatory educational and employment environment. The University admits qualified students, hires qualified employees and accepts patients for treatment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, marital status, national origin, age, disability, citizenship, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, veteran status, or other status protected by law. Its education and employment policies, scholarship and loan programs, and other programs and activities, are administered without unlawful discrimination. Department Economics & Finance Department Posted Thu, 08/27/2026 Apply by Open until filled Applying Creighton University uses Interfolio to manage the application process. Need help? Contact help and support . Share Email Facebook LinkedIn Twitter Close Sidebar ID Internal Resources Directory Office 365 BlueLine NEST Libraries Bookstore myCreighton Online Ministries Site Index Get In Touch Contact Creighton Jobs Maps & Directions Media Inquiries Locations Omaha, NE Phoenix, AZ 2500 California Plaza Omaha, NE 68178 402.280.2700 Image Translate © Creighton University\t2026 Legal / Non-Discrimination Policy Privacy Statement Web Accessibility Statement LinkedIn Facebook Instagram Youtube © Creighton University\t2026 LinkedIn Facebook Instagram Youtube"
